orc raider~
an orc raider~
A scruffy orc hunts for signs of elves.
~
This orc has been traveling for quite some time.  He is even dirtier than most
other orcs you have seen.  He keeps his eyes to the ground, watching for signs
of elves to ambush.  Be careful...he may try to attack you if he gets a good
chance.
~
